  "description": "Read-only source-to-target Dataverse environment comparison across every component class (solutions/publishers, tables/columns/relationships/keys, forms/views/charts/dashboards, roles/teams/business units, plugin assemblies/steps/images, processes, custom APIs, environment variables, connection references, web resources). Classifies each component Missing/Extra/Changed/Managed-vs-Unmanaged, rolls a weighted difference score with severities, and exports Excel/PDF/JSON/HTML. Secret-typed values are masked. Uses the suite dual-connection pattern for the target environment. Never writes to either environment.",
